   "fixing_commit_message": "fix: allow end of string as last character of file\n\nFixes issue #61\n\nIf `allowInvalid` is set to false, we threw an exception if the last\ncharacter of the CSV was a closing text-delimiter.\n\nWe didn't recognize this, as there is the possibility, that another\ntext-delimiter \"uncloses\" a text-field.  This is of course not possible\nif there are no characters left.",
